<h1>About CSBFP</h1>
<div class="about-intro">
<p>Certified Small Business Finance Professional (CSBFP) is a professional certification for individuals working in commercial finance. It is independently administered to ensure applicants are evaluated fairly and consistently.</p>
<p>CSBFP was created to establish a common standard for what professionals across the industry should know and how they should conduct themselves. The program covers financing products, applicable regulations, and professional responsibilities, including communicating terms clearly and protecting sensitive business information.</p>
<p>The purpose is to recognize individuals who demonstrate that foundational knowledge and to support better experiences for small business owners seeking financing.</p>
</div>

<h2>How it works</h2>
<ol class="numbered">
  <li>Create an account and complete your application.</li>
  <li>Accept the professional standards.</li>
  <li>Complete four short training modules.</li>
  <li>Pass a 20-question assessment.</li>
  <li>Pay the <%= program.annualFee %> annual certification fee.</li>
  <li>Complete a one-time background screening.</li>
  <li>Receive your certification number upon approval.</li>
</ol>

<div class="actions">
  <a class="button" href="/portal/signup">Get Certified</a>
